{"skill":{"slug":"google-maps-api","displayName":"Google Maps API"},"version":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1787304651467,"changelog":"- Major update: Migrated from Scavio API to fetcher.sh’s Google Maps API alternative.\n- Endpoints now use simple HTTP GET with pay-per-call pricing (no Google Cloud or API keys needed).\n- Supports both prepaid credits (Bearer key) and automatic x402 micro-payments.\n- Four endpoints: place search, place details, place reviews, and single review fetch.\n- Easier setup—no Google billing account or request quotas; simple authentication and transparent pricing.\n- Updated documentation, examples, and error handling to match the new API.","changelogSource":"auto","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":4923,"sha256":"43743e92badb3351b187b7f3812ea101d632fb986f0755338ba47a76ce954fbc","contentType":"application/octet-stream"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2330,"sha256":"836d396e632b8dba50ace0f84bfbcb7cc29248fc918c190c505c614567589c77","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789556968995,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b773801d4b5d2c5e654405dad429222e7faed1c6a6df5d7809ef1d722684ec29","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b773801d4b5d2c5e654405dad429222e7faed1c6a6df5d7809ef1d722684ec29","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1787305008558},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1789556968995},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a straightforward guide for using a paid Google Maps-style API service, with its network, payment, and credential use disclosed.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network calls send place queries, optional latitude/longitude, review IDs, and an API key or x402 payment flow to the external provider, which is expected for this service but privacy- and billing-relevant.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No installer, executable script, package dependency, or local mutation step is bundled; configuration consists of curl examples and an optional remote MCP server entry.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Instructions are limited to HTTP GET examples and optional MCP configuration, but users should note the skill references a separate fetcher skill for full payment mechanics that was not included in this artifact.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact does not request persistence, local file access, elevated privileges, background workers, or modification of agent tools; any stored Bearer key would come from the user's MCP/client configuration.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill documents place search, place details, and review lookup via google-maps.fetcher.sh; those capabilities match the stated Google Maps/Places API alternative purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, confirm you trust fetcher.sh with your search queries and any location coordinates, understand the $0.005-per-call pricing and no-refund note, and protect the FETCHER_API_KEY like any paid service credential.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789556968995}}}}}